    "Spacing that varies before it settles is how early stretches often look. A stretch timed now and then shows the same pattern — this doesn't need watching continuously.": {
      "comment": "sentence appended to the partial-pattern line when the stretch is wide and slow (decision 0041) — every word is about timing data, not her body; must never read as prognosis, instruction, or outcome reassurance",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Abstand, der schwankt, bevor er sich einpendelt, sieht bei frühen Serien oft so aus. Eine hin und wieder gemessene Serie zeigt dasselbe Muster — das braucht keine ununterbrochene Beobachtung."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spacing that varies before it settles is how early stretches often look. A stretch timed now and then shows the same pattern — this doesn't need watching continuously."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un espaciado que varía antes de asentarse es como suelen verse las primeras rachas. Una racha cronometrada de vez en cuando muestra el mismo patrón — esto no necesita vigilancia continua."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un intervalle qui varie avant de se stabiliser, c’est souvent l’allure des premières séries. Une série chronométrée de temps en temps montre le même rythme — cela ne demande pas une surveillance continue."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una distanza che varia prima di stabilizzarsi è spesso l’aspetto delle prime serie. Una serie cronometrata ogni tanto mostra lo stesso ritmo — non serve un controllo continuo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "落ち着く前に間隔がばらつくのは、初期の一連によくある見え方です。ときどき計測しても同じ傾向は見えます — ずっと見張っている必要はありません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "자리를 잡기 전 간격이 들쭉날쭉한 것은 초기 진통에서 흔한 모습이에요. 가끔 재어도 같은 흐름이 보입니다 — 계속 지켜볼 필요는 없어요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um intervalo que varia antes de se firmar é a cara das primeiras séries. Uma série marcada de vez em quando mostra o mesmo padrão — isso não precisa de acompanhamento contínuo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在稳定下来之前间隔忽长忽短，正是早期这一阵常见的样子。偶尔计一次也能看出同样的趋势 — 不需要一直盯着。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
